A L3 Harris spokesperson also stated that L3 Harris fully supports and will cooperate as needed with federal investigations as approximately 12,000 flights were disrupted, cancelled or rescheduled on 13 Nov, 2026 due to the grounding, with commercial airlines scrambling to move crews around to (mostly) comply with labor laws, as of the reporting here, approximately 4,000 flights were cancelled in the United States today (14 Nov, 2026) with less than 2,000 being rescheduled or postponed due to the outage yesterday.

